  "description": {
   "en": "Before Narumi Taiga, Bitou Tatsuya, King Joe and Tsukimoto Mitsumasa, there was Terakado Butta. This is the story of how, under his leadership, Housen became the powerhouse that would become Suzuran High School's greatest opponent. Butta was there the year the school was founded, and without him, we would have never had the Housen Hitman we know and fear today.",
   "ja": "戸亜留市の隣町にて、最強の名をほしいままにしていた中学生・寺門仏陀。彼は、恋をしたりダチとバカやったりフツーの青春がしたいと、ケンカをやめて新設校の鳳仙学園に入学するが…!?"
  },
